# Cloud Grafana & AWS CloudWatch Telemetry Verification SOP

> **Captured/Updated**: 2026-08-28  
> **Owner**: `@aea-devsecops-platform` with `@aea-cost-guardian`  
> **Traceability**: Issue #274, Cloud Observability SOP  

When configuring, deploying, or debugging Cloud Grafana or CloudWatch metrics in this repository, agents MUST follow this SOP and checklist to prevent empty panel errors (`"No data"`) or IAM authorization failures.

